choosing the best option. Provide only the text of the correct option as your answer.\n\nPassage: If Jenson Button has competed in a British Grand Prix for the last time, it can conclusively be said that his association with it was jinxed. He has never so much as had a podium in 16 attempts, and his brief participation in yesterday\u2019s race was fittingly disastrous. He crashed out on the first lap. \u2018I am disappointed, obviously,\u2019 said the 2009 world champion. \u2018In front of your home crowd you want to put on a good show and I wasn\u2019t able to do that after a turn-three incident and that is a shame.\u2019 Button started 18th on the grid, as McLaren-Honda continue to struggle for speed and reliability, and was ensnared in a collision involving the two Lotus cars.\n@highlight\nJenson Button's 16th British Grand Prix lasted less than 20 seconds\n@highlight\nButton's\u00a0miserable\u00a0luck at the race continued in a pile up at turn three\n@highlight\nIt is the first time since 2002 that Button has failed to finish three races\nQuery: But it was not total doom and gloom at @placeholder, with Alonso scoring his first point of the season.\n\nOptions : A. Honda\nB. British Grand Prix\nC. Jenson Button\nD. Button\nE. McLaren\nF. Lotus\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the contetn of the correct option. ", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The passage is about the British Grand Prix, and the query refers to \"it was not total doom and gloom at @placeholder\" \u2014 the placeholder should refer to the event where Alonso scored his first point, which is the same event being discussed: the British Grand Prix.\n\n\\boxed{B}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 340, "output_tokens": 68, "total_tokens": 408}}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "SuperGLUE-ClozeTest_11554", "prompt": "Read the following passage and answer the questi