ta}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 38, "output_tokens": 32, "total_tokens": 70}}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "WMT19-cs-en_38", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from Englisb to Czech.\n\nWhen the active component was purified from the liquid, it turned out to be a byproduct of tryptophan metabolism known as indole-3-lactic acid.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "Kdy\u017e byla aktivn\u00ed slo\u017eka purifikov\u00e1na z kapaliny, uk\u00e1zalo se, \u017ee jde o vedlej\u0161\u00ed produkt metabolismu tryptofanu zn\u00e1m\u00fd jako kyselina indol-3-ml\u00e9\u010dn\u00e1.\n\n\\boxed{Kdy\u017e byla aktivn\u00ed slo\u017eka purifikov\u00e1na z kapaliny, uk\u00e1zalo se, \u017ee jde o vedlej\u0161\u00ed produkt metabolismu tryptofanu zn\u00e1m\u00fd jako kyselina indol-3-ml\u00e9\u010dn\u00e1.}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 62, "output_tokens": 75, "total_tokens": 137}}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "WMT19-de-en_171", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nThe construction of the four wind turbines should cover the energy requirements of around 11,400 households \u2013 that equates to around a fifth of the energy requirements of all Viersen households.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "Der Bau der vier Windr\u00e4der soll den Energiebedarf von rund 11.400 Haushalten decken \u2013 das entspricht etwa einem F\u00fcnftel des Energiebedarfs aller Viersener Haushalte.\n\n\\boxed{Der Bau der vier Windr\u00e4der soll den Energiebedarf von rund 11.400 Haushalten decken \u2013 das entspricht etwa einem F\u00fcnftel des Energiebedarfs aller Viersener Haushalte.}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tok