al answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\"Emme voi vied\u00e4 lapsiamme p\u00e4iv\u00e4kotiin tai menn\u00e4 t\u00f6ihin ilman sit\u00e4\", Tommi sanoo.\n\n\\boxed{\"Emme voi vied\u00e4 lapsiamme p\u00e4iv\u00e4kotiin tai menn\u00e4 t\u00f6ihin ilman sit\u00e4\", Tommi sanoo.}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 53, "output_tokens": 69, "total_tokens": 122}}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "WMT19-de-en_42", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\n\"The White House is thrilled with the 'Made In America' showcase that featured products from all 50 states that are made by American workers with American materials,\" said White House deputy press secretary Lindsay Walters.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{\\text{\"Das Wei\u00dfe Haus ist begeistert von der 'Made In America'-Pr\u00e4sentation, die Produkte aus allen 50 Bundesstaaten zeigte, die von amerikanischen Arbeitern mit amerikanischen Materialien hergestellt wurden\", sagte die stellvertretende Pressesprecherin des Wei\u00dfen Hauses, Lindsay Walters.}}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 82, "output_tokens": 74, "total_tokens": 156}}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "WMT19-fi-en_932", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to Finnish.\n\nBy including the 200 letters (or nucleotides, per the artist's sophisticated scientific lexicon), Dewey-Hagborg hoped to illustrate how astoundingly similar, at least in biological makeup, we all are.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "Dewey-Hagborg halusi sis\u00e4llytt\u00e4m\u00e4ll\u00e4 200 kirjainta (tai nukleotidia, taiteilijan